      "html": "  <div id=\"system_welcome\" class=\"message message--formatted txt-align-center center\">\n    <div class=\"message__body center\">\n      <div class=\"message__body-content position-relative\">\n        <figure class=\"account-logo avatar center margin-block-end txt-large\"><img alt=\"Account logo\" src=\"/account/logo?v=20260101160000\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></figure>\n        <div class=\"flex align-center gap\">\n          <div class=\"system-welcome--translation\">\n            <details class=\"position-relative\" data-controller=\"popup\" data-action=\"keydown.esc-&gt;popup#close toggle-&gt;popup#toggle click@document-&gt;popup#closeOnClickOutside\" data-popup-orientation-top-class=\"popup-orientation-top\"><summary class=\"btn\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"color-icon\" src=\"/assets/globe-8c54d23b.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" /><span class=\"for-screen-reader\">Translate</span></summary><div class=\"language-list-menu shadow\" data-popup-target=\"menu\"><dl class=\"language-list\"><dt>🇺🇸</dt><dd class=\"margin-none\">Welcome to Smartfire. To invite some people to chat with you, share the join link below.</dd><dt>🇪🇸</dt><dd class=\"margin-none\">Bienvenido a Smartfire. Para invitar a algunas personas a chatear contigo, comparte el enlace de unión que se encuentra a continuación.</dd><dt>🇫🇷</dt><dd class=\"margin-none\">Bienvenue sur Smartfire. Pour inviter des personnes à discuter avec vous, partagez le lien pour rejoindre ci-dessous.</dd><dt>🇮🇳</dt><dd class=\"margin-none\">Smartfire में आपका स्वागत है। अधिक लोगों को चैट के लिए आमंत्रित करने के लिए, नीचे जुड़ने का लिंक साझा करें।</dd><dt>🇩🇪</dt><dd class=\"margin-none\">Willkommen bei Smartfire. Um einige Personen zum Chatten einzuladen, teilen Sie den unten stehenden Beitrittslink.</dd><dt>🇧🇷</dt><dd class=\"margin-none\">Boas vindas ao Smartfire. Para convidar pessoas para conversarem com você, compartilhe o link de convite abaixo.</dd><dt>🇯🇵</dt><dd class=\"margin-none\">Smartfireへようこそ。他の人をチャットに招待するには、下記の参加リンクを共有してください。</dd></dl></div></details>\n          </div>\n          <p>\n            <strong>Welcome to Smartfire</strong><br>\n            To invite people to chat, share the join link below.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-column align-center gap\">\n\n  <label class=\"flex flex-column gap full-width\" style=\"--row-gap: 0.5em\">\n    <strong id=\"invite_label\" class=\"invite-label\">Share to invite more people</strong>\n    <span class=\"flex align-center gap input input--actor fill-white\">\n      <img aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"colorize--black\" src=\"/assets/person-add-1432b76b.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" class=\"input\" id=\"invite_url\" value=\"http://campfire.test/join/CRMu-l8Ge-KB9B\" aria-labelledby=\"invite_label\" readonly>\n    </span>\n  </label>\n\n  <div class=\"flex align-center gap\">\n    <a class=\"btn\" data-lightbox-target=\"image\" data-action=\"lightbox#open\" data-lightbox-url-value=\"/qr_code/aHR0cDovL2NhbXBmaXJlLnRlc3Qvam9pbi9DUk11LWw4R2UtS0I5Qg==\" href=\"/qr_code/aHR0cDovL2NhbXBmaXJlLnRlc3Qvam9pbi9DUk11LWw4R2UtS0I5Qg==\">\n      <span class=\"for-screen-reader\">Show join link QR code</span>\n      <img aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"colorize--black\" src=\"/assets/qr-code-dac3b273.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" />\n</a>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-controller=\"copy-to-clipboard\" data-action=\"copy-to-clipboard#copy\" data-copy-to-clipboard-success-class=\"btn--success\" data-copy-to-clipboard-content-value=\"http://campfire.test/join/CRMu-l8Ge-KB9B\">\n      <span class=\"for-screen-reader\">Copy join link</span>\n      <img aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"colorize--black\" src=\"/assets/copy-paste-4c379063.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" />\n</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" hidden=\"hidden\" data-controller=\"web-share\" data-action=\"web-share#share\" data-web-share-url-value=\"http://campfire.test/join/CRMu-l8Ge-KB9B\" data-web-share-text-value=\"Hit this link to join me in Smartfire and start chatting.\" data-web-share-title-value=\"Link to join Smartfire\">\n      <span class=\"for-screen-reader\">Share join link</span>\n      <img aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"colorize--black\" src=\"/assets/share-bf28da4f.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" />\n</button>\n      <form class=\"button_to\" method=\"post\" action=\"/account/join_code\"><button class=\"btn btn--regenerate\" type=\"submit\">\n        <img aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"colorize--black\" src=\"/assets/refresh-249f0509.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" />\n        <span class=\"for-screen-reader\">Regenerate join link</span>\n</button><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"authenticity_token\" value=\"post:/account/join_code\" /></form>  </div>\n</div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n"
